{"seq":3,"slug":"accumulation-phase","title":"积累期策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/accumulation-phase","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"savings-rate","title":"储蓄率与财富积累","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/accumulation-phase/savings-rate","wordCount":2666,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"employer-benefits","title":"雇主福利最大化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/accumulation-phase/employer-benefits","wordCount":2519,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"side-income-entrepreneurship","title":"副业与创业退休路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/accumulation-phase/side-income-entrepreneurship","wordCount":2626,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"积累期策略\">积累期策略</h1><p>积累期（Accumulation Phase）是从开始工作到退休之间的阶段，目标是尽可能多地积累退休资金。这一阶段的核心变量只有三个：<strong>储蓄率</strong>、<strong>投资回报率</strong>和<strong>时间</strong>。</p>\n<p>数学告诉我们一个反直觉的事实：对大多数人而言，<strong>储蓄率比投资回报率更重要</strong>——尤其是在积累初期。一个储蓄率 30% 但只获得 5% 回报的人，往往比储蓄率 10% 但获得 10% 回报的人更快达到退休目标。</p>\n<p>本章从储蓄率的力量出发，延伸到如何最大化雇主福利（免费的&quot;匹配&quot;），最后探讨通过副业和创业构建多元收入来源的可能性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>储蓄率与财富积累</td>\n<td>储蓄率优先原则、收入分层路径、强制储蓄机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>雇主福利最大化</td>\n<td>企业年金匹配、补充医疗、股权激励退休应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副业与创业退休路径</td>\n<td>被动收入构建、数字资产、小企业退休规划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}